### ========================
### CONTACT ENDPOINTS
### ========================

### Create contact 1 for company 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Smith",
  "title": "Engineering Manager",
  "email": "john.smith@google.com",
  "phoneNumber": "425-555-1234",
  "companyId": 1
}

###

### Create contact 2 for company 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Doe",
  "title": "Senior Recruiter",
  "email": "jane.doe@google.com",
  "phoneNumber": "425-555-5678",
  "companyId": 1
}

###

### Get all contacts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contacts

###

### Get contact by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contacts/1

###

### Search contacts by company id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contacts/search?companyId=1

###

### Update contact - reassign to company 2
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/contacts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Smith",
  "title": "Principal Engineer",
  "email": "john.smith@microsoft.com",
  "phoneNumber": "425-555-1234",
  "companyId": 2
}

###

### Verify reassignment - search company 2 contacts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contacts/search?companyId=2

