### ========================
### APPLICATION ENDPOINTS
### ========================

### Create application with contact for listing 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateApplied": "2026-02-15",
  "notes": "Referred by John Smith",
  "applicationStatus": "APPLIED",
  "jobListingId": 1,
  "contactId": 1
}

###

### Create application without contact for listing 2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateApplied": "2026-02-20",
  "notes": "Applied through LinkedIn",
  "applicationStatus": "APPLIED",
  "jobListingId": 2
}

###

### Try duplicate application for listing 1 - should error
POST http://localhost:8080/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateApplied": "2026-02-15",
  "notes": "Duplicate attempt",
  "applicationStatus": "APPLIED",
  "jobListingId": 1
}

###

### Get all applications
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications

###

### Get application by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications/1

###

### Update status via PATCH
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/applications/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

"PHONE_SCREEN"

###

### Verify status update
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications/1

###

### Update full application - add contact to application 2
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/applications/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateApplied": "2026-02-20",
  "notes": "Heard back after applying through LinkedIn",
  "applicationStatus": "INTERVIEW",
  "jobListingId": 2,
  "contactId": 2
}

###

### Verify full update
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications/2

###

### Delete application 2
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/applications/2

###

### Verify deletion - should error
GET http://localhost:8080/api/applications/2

